### ==========================================================
### 进货入库
### 先保证 {{token}} 有效，且已有商品
### ==========================================================

### 1. 来源1：从我的商品进货补货
POST http://localhost:8080/api/purchases/my-products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "productId": 2,
  "combinationId": 1,
  "quantity": 10
}

### 2. 来源2：新建商品并入库（一步完成）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/purchases/new-product
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "新进货T恤",
  "categoryId": 22,
  "purchasePrice": 35.00,
  "sellingPrice": 79.00,
  "imageUrl": "",
  "combinations": [
    { "attrsJson": "{\"颜色\":\"白色\",\"尺码\":\"L\"}", "stock": 30 },
    { "attrsJson": "{\"颜色\":\"黑色\",\"尺码\":\"XL\"}", "stock": 20 }
  ]
}
